1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:03,354
What if everything around you could become 3D?

2
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:08,371
Put on the headset… and look!

3
00:00:15,550 --> 00:00:18,908
A car. I point at it, and the AI outlines it…

4
00:00:23,550 --> 00:00:25,299
…draws it from every side…

5
00:00:32,900 --> 00:00:34,590
…and here it is, in 3D!

6
00:00:38,250 --> 00:00:40,272
This is Mitsinjo Grid VR.

7
00:00:50,850 --> 00:00:53,535
Let's start in the kitchen. I scan the room…

8
00:00:56,850 --> 00:00:58,770
Let's take the fridge, for example.

9
00:00:59,600 --> 00:01:02,784
First, the AI draws it in 2D, from every side.

10
00:01:03,150 --> 00:01:05,920
One view is off? I just ask for a change.

11
00:01:07,200 --> 00:01:11,161
Now I validate… and the 3D model is built, piece by piece.

12
00:01:18,483 --> 00:01:22,217
Next, the sofa in the hall. Same thing: the 2D views…

13
00:01:28,633 --> 00:01:31,569
…then the 3D. Look at that tufted velvet!

14
00:01:37,233 --> 00:01:39,714
Out on the terrace… why not the whole house?

15
00:01:42,633 --> 00:01:45,661
Its facade in 2D… and the house in 3D.

16
00:01:55,483 --> 00:01:57,388
And down the street, this white car.

17
00:02:00,883 --> 00:02:03,537
From its profile… to a full 3D model.

18
00:02:13,333 --> 00:02:21,762
Under the hood: SAM 3.1 outlines it, Muse Image draws it, and Muse Spark, with skill cards and specialist agents, builds it.

19
00:02:22,283 --> 00:02:27,532
But it's not just 3D generation. I can drop it into a village… and walk around it, freely.

20
00:02:32,583 --> 00:02:34,706
There's my car, parked in the village!

21
00:02:38,133 --> 00:02:41,250
Here's the village. And here's a map, to find my way.

22
00:02:48,800 --> 00:02:54,615
Now, let's fast-forward a little, to seven p.m. Meanwhile, we stroll through the village… in fast motion!

23
00:02:56,350 --> 00:02:58,509
Here we are, at the dispatch controller.

24
00:03:00,533 --> 00:03:05,214
Let's control the power of the village homes. I cut it… and look, the lights fade.

25
00:03:08,783 --> 00:03:09,972
And back on!

26
00:03:12,633 --> 00:03:18,013
Now the health center. I try to cut it… refused! The clinic always keeps its power.

27
00:03:20,883 --> 00:03:25,644
Mitsinjo Grid VR. Point at the world. Build it. Power it.
